{"type": "mcq", "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Which expression is equivalent to&nbsp;<math alttext=\"100 x squared plus 2,600\"><mn>100</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2,600</mn></math>?</p>", "keys": ["6f9aaa03-ec44-4a39-9c7f-5dac84fca575"], "answerOptions": [{"id": "e4b5392b-167f-4a88-8cd0-cad63213d722", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"100 left parenthesis 26 x squared right parenthesis\"><mn>100</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>26</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"}, {"id": "6f9aaa03-ec44-4a39-9c7f-5dac84fca575", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"100 left parenthesis x squared plus 26 right parenthesis\"><mn>100</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>26</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"}, {"id": "2467e7b2-81fc-4e84-a901-b0525aef47f7", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"2,600 left parenthesis 100 x squared right parenthesis\"><mn>2,600</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>100</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"}, {"id": "57f04615-e4d9-452b-8421-fb703f71b602", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"2,600 left parenthesis 100 x squared plus 1 right parenthesis\"><mn>2,600</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>100</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"}], "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is correct. Each term in the given expression,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"100 x squared plus 2,600\"><mn>100</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2,600</mn></math>, has a common factor of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"100\"><mn>100</mn></math>. Therefore, the expression can be rewritten as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"100 left parenthesis x squared right parenthesis plus 100 left parenthesis 26 right parenthesis\"><mn>100</mn><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>)</mo></math>, or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"100 left parenthesis x squared plus 26 right parenthesis\"><mn>100</mn><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>)</mo></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This expression is equivalent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"2,600 x squared\"><mn>2,600</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>, not <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"100 x squared plus 2,600\"><mn>100</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2,600</mn></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This expression is equivalent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"260,000 x squared\"><mn>260,000</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>, not <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"100 x squared plus 2,600\"><mn>100</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2,600</mn></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect. This expression is equivalent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"260,000 x squared plus 2,600\"><mn>260,000</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2,600</mn></math>, not <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"100 x squared plus 2,600\"><mn>100</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2,600</mn></math>.</p>", "externalid": "14779160-e23c-403b-98af-36fdefea4b8e", "correct_answer": ["B"]}